<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/</id><title>ZhgChgLi (Harry Li)</title><subtitle>An iOS, web, and automation developer from Taiwan 🇹🇼 who also loves sharing, traveling, and writing.</subtitle> <updated>2026-04-06T12:18:46+08:00</updated> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> <uri>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/</uri> </author><link rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/ios-app-development.xml"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="zh-cn" href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/"/> <generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.3.4">Jekyll</generator> <rights> © 2026 ZhgChgLi </rights> <icon>/assets/img/favicons/favicon.ico</icon> <logo>/assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png</logo> <entry><title>iOS Certificates、Identifiers与Profiles详解｜Fastlane Match统一管理凭证与CI/CD整合实战</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-certificates-identifiers%E4%B8%8Eprofiles%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-fastlane-match%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8Eci-cd%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-823ac523ccc8/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="iOS Certificates、Identifiers与Profiles详解｜Fastlane Match统一管理凭证与CI/CD整合实战" /><published>2026-01-04T01:03:46+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-05T08:55:47+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-certificates-identifiers%E4%B8%8Eprofiles%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-fastlane-match%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8Eci-cd%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-823ac523ccc8/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-certificates-identifiers%E4%B8%8Eprofiles%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-fastlane-match%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8Eci-cd%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-823ac523ccc8/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>针对iOS开发者与团队，解决凭证混乱与管理困难问题，透过Fastlane Match统一管理Certificates、Profiles并安全同步至Git私有库，搭配GitHub Actions实现CI/CD自动化，提升开发效率与凭证安全性。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>App Store Connect API Webhook 串接｜提升 iOS CI/CD 自动化效率与通知流程</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/app-store-connect-api-webhook-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-ios-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B-7c0974856393/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="App Store Connect API Webhook 串接｜提升 iOS CI/CD 自动化效率与通知流程" /><published>2025-12-27T17:02:01+08:00</published> <updated>2025-12-27T17:05:14+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/app-store-connect-api-webhook-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-ios-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B-7c0974856393/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/app-store-connect-api-webhook-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-ios-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B-7c0974856393/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>针对 iOS 开发者面临的建置等待与通知延迟问题，透过 App Store Connect API Webhook 实现即时事件推送，结合 Fastlane 与 CI/CD 工具，打造零等待成本的自动化工作流程，提升团队开发效率与发布准确度。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>iOS Timer 与 DispatchSourceTimer 选择与安全封装技巧｜有限状态机防止闪退</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-timer-%E4%B8%8E-dispatchsourcetimer-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7-%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E9%97%AA%E9%80%80-62f68ebeecd3/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="iOS Timer 与 DispatchSourceTimer 选择与安全封装技巧｜有限状态机防止闪退" /><published>2025-12-14T16:17:06+08:00</published> <updated>2025-12-15T00:24:36+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-timer-%E4%B8%8E-dispatchsourcetimer-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7-%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E9%97%AA%E9%80%80-62f68ebeecd3/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ios-timer-%E4%B8%8E-dispatchsourcetimer-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7-%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E9%97%AA%E9%80%80-62f68ebeecd3/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>iOS 开发必备 Timer 使用指南，解析 Timer 与 DispatchSourceTimer 优缺点，并提供有限状态机封装 DispatchSourceTimer，避免闪退及 Race Condition，实现高精度且安全的定时任务管理。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>Google Offerwall 广告｜内容创作者快速转换流量为收益的奖励墙方案</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/google-offerwall-%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A-%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%9B%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%96%E5%8A%B1%E5%A2%99%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-ba132457e6a5/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Google Offerwall 广告｜内容创作者快速转换流量为收益的奖励墙方案" /><published>2025-07-24T16:15:09+08:00</published> <updated>2025-07-24T16:26:29+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/google-offerwall-%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A-%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%9B%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%96%E5%8A%B1%E5%A2%99%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-ba132457e6a5/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/google-offerwall-%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A-%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%9B%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%96%E5%8A%B1%E5%A2%99%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-ba132457e6a5/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>内容创作者透过 Google Offerwall 广告，轻松设定任务解锁内容，无需自行开发系统，快速将流量转换为稳定收益，适合中小型网站与个人部落格，提升变现效率并扩展多元获利模式。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>CI/CD 打包工具平台｜使用 Google Apps Script Web App 串接 GitHub Actions 提升跨团队效率</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ci-cd-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8-google-apps-script-web-app-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-github-actions-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%B7%A8%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-4273e57e7148/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="CI/CD 打包工具平台｜使用 Google Apps Script Web App 串接 GitHub Actions 提升跨团队效率" /><published>2025-07-10T20:30:51+08:00</published> <updated>2025-11-19T23:59:42+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ci-cd-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8-google-apps-script-web-app-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-github-actions-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%B7%A8%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-4273e57e7148/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ci-cd-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8-google-apps-script-web-app-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-github-actions-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%B7%A8%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-4273e57e7148/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>打造免费且易用的打包工具平台，解决非工程人员操作 GitHub Actions 的复杂性与权限控管问题，透过 Google Apps Script Web App 整合 GitHub、Slack、Firebase 等 API，实现跨团队任务单打包与即时进度通知，提升开发与验证效率。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>GitHub Actions iOS CI/CD｜完整实作自动化建置、测试与部署流程教学</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-ios-ci-cd-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-4b001d2e8440/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="GitHub Actions iOS CI/CD｜完整实作自动化建置、测试与部署流程教学" /><published>2025-07-07T23:02:24+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-04T11:38:01+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-ios-ci-cd-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-4b001d2e8440/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-ios-ci-cd-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-4b001d2e8440/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>针对iOS开发者打造的GitHub Actions CI/CD流程，解决手动建置与测试繁琐问题，结合Fastlane与Firebase实现自动化打包与部署，提升团队开发效率与产品品质。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>GitHub Actions｜Self-hosted Runner 详解与实战案例｜CI/CD 自动化工作流程建置</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-self-hosted-runner-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-404bd5c70040/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="GitHub Actions｜Self-hosted Runner 详解与实战案例｜CI/CD 自动化工作流程建置" /><published>2025-07-02T20:22:32+08:00</published> <updated>2025-07-12T22:49:01+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-self-hosted-runner-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-404bd5c70040/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/github-actions-self-hosted-runner-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE-404bd5c70040/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>针对开发团队自动化需求，解析 GitHub Actions 与 Self-hosted Runner 架构与设定，并透过三大实战案例教你快速建立自动标记 PR、指派负责人及每日 PR 统计通知，提升 CI/CD 执行效率与成本优化。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>CI/CD 是什么｜打造高效稳定开发团队的关键流程与工具选择</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/ci-cd-%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88-%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E9%AB%98%E6%95%8